@page "/about"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About us";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Meet the two-person team behind Finance Freedom and learn about our commitment to free, practical money tools.";
}
<div class="container about-shell py-5">
    <section class="about-hero">
        <div class="about-hero-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <span class="about-eyebrow"><span></span> A LITTLE ABOUT US</span>
        <h1>Better with money.<br /><em>One step at a time.</em></h1>
        <p>We’re a two-man team with a simple aim: help everyone feel more confident about their finances, one small step at a time.</p>
        <a class="btn about-hero-link" href="#our-promise">What we believe <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
    </section>

    <section class="about-story">
        <div class="about-story-mark" aria-hidden="true">F<span>F</span></div>
        <div>
            <span class="section-kicker">WHY WE’RE BUILDING THIS</span>
            <h2>Money tools should feel useful, clear, and within reach.</h2>
            <p>Looking after your finances can feel like a lot. We’re building Finance Freedom to make it easier to see what’s coming in, understand where it’s going, and find a next step that works for you.</p>
            <p>We’re a small team, so the app is always evolving. We’re committed to improving it as much as we can, listening to feedback, fixing rough edges, and adding practical tools over time.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-promise" id="our-promise">
        <div class="about-promise-heading"><span class="section-kicker">OUR PROMISE</span><h2>Helpful tools for everyone.</h2><p>Finance Freedom will always be free to use. We want everyone to have access to simple tools that can help them make sense of their money.</p></div>
        <div class="about-values">
            <article><span>01</span><h3>Free to use</h3><p>There’s no paid plan required to use Finance Freedom’s core tools.</p></article>
            <article><span>02</span><h3>Always improving</h3><p>We’ll keep working to make the app clearer, more useful, and easier to use.</p></article>
            <article><span>03</span><h3>Here to help</h3><p>If you have a question or need a hand, email us. We’ll do our best to help wherever we can.</p></article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-contact">
        <div><span class="section-kicker">TWO PEOPLE, ONE OPEN INBOX</span><h2>Need help or want to share an idea?</h2><p>We welcome questions, suggestions, and general budgeting conversations. Tell us what’s on your mind and we’ll do our best to point you in a helpful direction.</p></div>
        <a class="btn about-email-button" href="mailto:Zection6@gmail.com?subject=Finance%20Freedom%20question">Email us <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>
    <p class="about-guidance-note">We can help with the app and share general budgeting information. Our replies aren’t personalised or regulated financial advice.</p>
</div>
